        text: "'Credits:"
      - kind: Newline
        text: "\r\n"
      - kind: EndOfLineComment
        text: "'        Special thanks to Barry G., a government research scientist who took an interest in my"
      - kind: Newline
        text: "\r\n"
      - kind: EndOfLineComment
        text: "'        steganography software and research in late 1999.  I never met Barry in person, but he"
      - kind: Newline
        text: "\r\n"
      - kind: EndOfLineComment
        text: "'        was kind enough to buy and mail me a book with the ISO DIS 10918-1 JPEG standard."
      - kind: Newline
